          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "html",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<style>.mbr-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.mbr-grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}.mbr-grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}@media(max-width:720px){.mbr-grid-2,.mbr-grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mbr-hero-nav-links{display:none!important}}.mbr-hero-h1 br{display:inline}@media(min-width:720px){.mbr-hero-h1 br{display:block}}</style><div style=\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;\"><div class=\"mbr-glass-nav\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 20px;margin-bottom:60px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><span style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:#FAC775;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#412402;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\">M</span><span style=\"font-weight:500;font-size:14px;color:#fff;\">Little Web Shack</span></div><div class=\"mbr-hero-nav-links\" style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:13px;\"><a href=\"#\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration:none;\">Home</a><a href=\"#\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration:none;\">Plugins</a><a href=\"#\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration:none;\">Dev tools</a><a href=\"#\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration:none;\">Blog</a><a href=\"#\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration:none;\">Contact</a></div></div><div style=\"max-width:660px;\"><span class=\"mbr-glass-pill\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">v1.12.1</strong><span style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\">·</span><span>Free forever, no upsells</span></span><h1 class=\"mbr-heading-hero mbr-hero-h1\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">Real control over<br>WordPress performance.</h1><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 30px;max-width:580px;\">Granular, transparent optimisation for WordPress. Every toggle explains what it does and what to expect — no black-box magic, no &ldquo;one big button&rdquo; that breaks your site.</p><div class=\"mbr-row\"><a href=\"#download\" class=\"mbr-btn mbr-btn-primary\"><i class=\"fas fa-download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Download free &nbsp;·&nbsp; v1.12.1</a><a href=\"#guide\" class=\"mbr-btn mbr-btn-glass\"><i class=\"fas fa-book\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> User guide (PDF)</a><a href=\"https://github.com/harbourbob\" class=\"mbr-btn mbr-btn-text\"><i class=\"fab fa-github\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> View on GitHub</a></div></div></div>"
