        {
          "id": "mbrfeat2",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "html",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<div style=\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\"><span class=\"mbr-eyebrow\">Built for control</span><h2 class=\"mbr-heading-section\">Eight modules. Zero black boxes.</h2><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:14px;margin:8px auto 0;max-width:500px;line-height:1.55;\">Every feature is granular and clearly explained. Toggle what helps your site, leave what doesn&rsquo;t.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-grid-2\"><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--amber\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">WordPress core</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">Disable features you don&rsquo;t use. Strip emoji scripts, REST bloat, comments and third-party noise.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--purple\"><i class=\"fas fa-code\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">Scripts &amp; styles</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">Defer JS, delay until interaction, generate critical CSS, remove unused styles, optimise jQuery.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--blue\"><i class=\"fas fa-font\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">Fonts &amp; typography</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">Self-host Google Fonts, subset, preload, optimise icon fonts and external font loading.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--teal\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">Preload &amp; lazy load</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">Speculative loading, preconnect, lazy load images, videos and CSS background images.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--coral\"><i class=\"fas fa-database\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">Database &amp; cleanup</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">Revisions, transients, orphaned data, table optimisation and scheduled auto-cleanup.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--amber\"><i class=\"fas fa-image\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">Image optimisation</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">WebP conversion on upload, bulk converter, auto-resize, injected width/height attributes.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--pink\"><i class=\"fas fa-shopping-cart\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">WooCommerce</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">Cart-fragments control, conditional asset loading, expired session cleanup, wc-admin trimming.</p></div><div class=\"mbr-glass\" style=\"padding:20px 22px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><span class=\"mbr-feature-icon mbr-feature-icon--purple\"><i class=\"fas fa-network-wired\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;margin:0;color:#fff;\">Multisite support</h3></div><p class=\"mbr-text-muted\" style=\"font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.55;\">Network-wide activation, push defaults to every site, per-site overrides, auto-setup for new sites.</p></div></div></div>"
          },
